{"exclude": "impl#1-legacy newline shape (S469, dpa-073 F5): pins how impl#1 ends a single-expression arm body at a line break. The arm `.A :> return;` is followed by an orphan `\"orphan\",` line at arm level, which impl#1 reports as E-PARSE-001. The arm-comma codemod (f0c9d4bb7) gave the arm list its commas. The bootstrap still refuses the case: E-PARSE-ARM for the `;` after the arm's `return`, and E-PARSE-ITEM for its legacy `<out> : string` cells. Kept unmigrated so impl#1's legacy reading stays guarded; not a bootstrap input."}
